ABOUT MAINSTAY
a) Welcome!
Welcome to Mainstay! We are excited to have you join our team. As an employee of
Mainstay (or “the Company”), you are a valuable part of an innovative team of
professionals who are transforming the single family rental real estate experience. We
take pride in our employees and strive to provide a friendly, safe, and productive work
environment that will enable you to thrive. Whether you are new to Mainstay or have
worked here for a period of time, we are confident you will find Mainstay to be a dynamic
and rewarding place to work, and we look forward to a productive and successful
working relationship with you.
To help us achieve our plans for the future growth and development of our business, we
need to establish a firm foundation on which to build and to provide our employees with
the support and resources needed to be successful. An important part of this is to
establish basic rules and guidelines concerning your employment. This Mainstay
Employee Handbook (the “Handbook”) is your guide to working at Mainstay. The
employment policies and/or benefits summaries in this Handbook are written for all
employees.
Once again, welcome to the team! We wish you success in your employment here at
Mainstay!
b) Our Mission & Vision
As part of Opendoor since 2020, we began building infrastructure to make high-quality
single-family homes accessible to everyone seeking the flexibility and affordability of
renting. Our market intelligence and tools make it easier for owners and operators to
focus on what matters most: serving residents.
Now, as an independent technology company, we're on a mission to build the most
comprehensive market intelligence platform in the single-family rental
industry—powering informed decision-making and unlocking opportunities for owners,
operators, and residents.
