All questions regarding the use of Mainstay assets, technology, and systems, along with
the Acceptable Use policy should be directed to the Security GRC Team.The GRITS Team
periodically monitors adherence to this Policy to help ensure legal, contractual, and
business requirements. Failure to comply with this Policy may result in disciplinary action
up to and including termination. Report suspected violations of this policy to the Security
GRC Team
e) Closed Circuit Television (CCTV) Monitoring & Recording
