CCTV may capture your personal and biometric data including but not limited to audio,
electronic, visual, thermal, olfactory, and/or similar information or personal data resulting
from specific technical processing relating to the physical, physiological or behavioral
characteristics of a natural person, which allow or confirm the unique identification of that
natural person.
Legitimate safety and security and/or investigation purposes for CCTV monitoring include
