Mainstay understands the importance of work-life flexibility and the wellbeing of our
employees. This paid time off (PTO) policy is designed to provide our dedicated
teammates with the flexibility and time they need to rest, recharge and attend to personal
priorities. PTO may be used for any reason, including any reason covered by an
applicable paid sick leave law (and in accordance with said applicable paid sick leave
law). To the extent permitted by law, paid sick leave should be used first. To be eligible to
