Mainstay strictly prohibits discrimination and retaliation against any employee for
asserting any claim or right to paid sick time under applicable law, assisting any other
person in doing so, or informing any person of their rights under applicable law.
Employees with any concerns regarding discrimination or retaliation in violation of this
policy must immediately alert the People Team at hr@mainstay.io. If you have additional
questions about the Company’s FTO policy, PTO policy or paid sick leave, or for additional
details, please contact the People Team at hr@mainstay.io.
