PHEL.
No Carryover/Cash Out - Unused PHEL does not carry over from year to year, and is not
cashed out at any time during employment or upon separation of employment.
No Retaliation/Discrimination - Employees may request and use PHEL under this policy
without fear of discrimination or retaliation, which Company policy prohibits. Please
contact Human Resources with any questions.
